{"parse": {"title": "Clam", "pageid": 233851, "revid": 15364241, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{otheruses|the clams found underwater|the ocean encounter|Giant clam}}\n{{Infobox Scenery\n|version1 = Closed\n|version2 = Opened\n|name = Clam\n|image1 = [[File:Clam.png|284px]]\n|image2 = [[File:Clam (opened).png|284px]]\n|release = [[7 September]] [[2017]]\n|update = Fossil Island\n|members = Yes\n|quest = [[Bone Voyage]]\n|location = [[Underwater]] area of [[Fossil Island]]\n|options1 = None\n|options2 = Search\n|examine1 = It's... sleeping?\n|examine2 = I wonder what's inside?\n|map = {{Map|3794,10297|3811,10293|3815,10285|3835,10281|3833,10268|3833,10258|3813,10249|3803,10247|3791,10269|3787,10256|3785,10266|3784,10272|3779,10274|3777,10242|3767,10246|3766,10264|3744,10242|3730,10242|3720,10247|3716,10248|plane=1|mapID=-1|mtype=pin}}\n|id1 = 30970\n|id2 = 30969\n}}\n'''Clams''' are located in the [[Underwater]] area of [[Fossil Island]]. They are part of the [[Underwater Agility and Thieving]] training activity. When in their opened state, players can search them for a chance to receive [[glistening tear]]s and [[mermaid's tear]]s. Successfully searching a clam also rewards a small amount of [[Agility]] and [[Thieving]] experience. Failing a search will either display the message {{Mes|You jerk back as something nibbles your hand.}} with no additional effect, or the message {{Mes|You jerk back as something nibbles your hand and lose some breath.}}, depleting the player's [[oxygen level]].\n\nAdditionally, players can keep searching the same chest multiple times, until it closes. For these extra searches, there is a 1/8.5 chance to receive one of each tear.\n\n==Skill info==\n{{Skill info\n|name = Clam\n|skill1name = Agility\n|skill2name = Thieving\n|skill1lvl = 1\n|skill2lvl = 1\n|skill1exp = 4.5\n|skill2exp = 4.5\n|loc = [[Underwater Agility and Thieving]]\n}}\n\n==Locations==\n{{ObjectTableHead}}\n{{ObjectLocLine\n|name = Chest\n|location = [[Underwater]], {{FloorNumber|uk=0}}\n|members = Yes\n|mapID = 30\n|plane = 0\n|3794,10297|3811,10293|3815,10285|3835,10281|3833,10268|3833,10258|3813,10249|3803,10247|3791,10269|3787,10256|3785,10266|3784,10272|3779,10274|3777,10242|3767,10246|3766,10264|3744,10242|3730,10242|3720,10247|3716,10248\n|mtype = pin\n|leagueRegion = misthalin\n}}\n{{ObjectTableBottom}}\n\n==Drops==\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Nothing|rarity=15/17|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Mermaid's tear|quantity=1|rarity=2/17|raritynotes=<ref name=\"guaranteed\" group=\"n\">The first search after the blinking arrow moved is always successful, with subsequent searches having specified success chance.</ref>|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Glistening tear|quantity=1|rarity=2/17|raritynotes=<ref name=\"guaranteed\" group=\"n\"/>|skill=Thieving}}\n{{FossilDropLines|fossil=6|numulite=20|access=2/17|skill=Thieving}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n{{Reflist|group=n}}\n\n==Changes==\n{{Subject changes header}}\n{{Subject changes\n|type = hotfix\n|date = 8 September 2017\n|update = Fossil Island Feedback\n|change = Buffed the thieving chance from 1:10 to 1:8.5.\n}}\n{{Subject changes footer}}\n\n{{Fossil Island}}"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:21:53.356795+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header drop-disp-btn unsortable\" title=\"Sort items by category, rarity and name.\"></th>\n<th style=\"border-left: none;\" class=\"item-col\">Item</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Quantity</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th class=\"ge-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th>\n<th class=\"alch-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">High Alch</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td class=\"inventory-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Nothing\" title=\"Nothing\"><img alt=\"This does not exist.\" src=\"/images/Bank_filler.p